      "text": "Trade Marks Act 1995 Trade Mark Regulations 1995 If no fee is paid in relation to a document requiring a fee, the following procedures apply:"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "If filed via paper, a non-payment receipt is given to acknowledge receipt of documents."
        }
      ],
      "cases": [],
      "chunk_ref": "TMM/Part4/6/6/1/1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:268d3c79ef03513ac8a9779dccba3e2fce23dfc93e18b53333710ec5b8c88d90",
      "fragment": null,
      "heading_path": [
        "Part 4 Fees",
        "Part 4.6. No fee paid",
        "6.1 Receipt of documents requiring a fee but for which no fee has been paid",
        "6.1.1"
      ],
      "heading_source": "emphasis",
      "headings": [
        {
          "level": 3,
          "ref": null,
          "source": "markup"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "ref": "TMM/Part4/6/6/1/1",
          "source": "emphasis"
        }
      ],
      "internal_refs": [],
      "kind": "body",
      "links": [],
      "ordinal": 2,
      "page_ref": "TMM/Part4/6",
      "provisions": [],
      "tables": [],
      "text": "If filed via paper, a non-payment receipt is given to acknowledge receipt of documents."
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "The document is stamped with the date received."
        }
      ],
      "cases": [],
      "chunk_ref": "TMM/Part4/6/6/1/2",
      "content_hash": "sha256:fde405f7511aa27f5da4d2124f4e49c991db341b3710f6513c01cce8a008c4f8",
      "fragment": null,
      "heading_path": [
        "Part 4 Fees",
        "Part 4.6. No fee paid",
        "6.1 Receipt of documents requiring a fee but for which no fee has been paid",
        "6.1.2"
      ],
      "heading_source": "emphasis",
      "headings": [
        {
          "level": 3,
          "ref": null,
          "source": "markup"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "ref": "TMM/Part4/6/6/1/2",
          "source": "emphasis"
        }
      ],
      "internal_refs": [],
      "kind": "body",
      "links": [],
      "ordinal": 3,
      "page_ref": "TMM/Part4/6",
      "provisions": [],
      "tables": [],
      "text": "The document is stamped with the date received."
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "If no fee is paid and there is no authorisation of payment, a Notice of Underpayment (NoU) will be issued."
        }
      ],
      "cases": [],
      "chunk_ref": "TMM/Part4/6/6/2/1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:fe5adc631bda878d370a3ac13dc3fede2cca2b49ca2c11a7018bf01e5a6ee7b8",
      "fragment": null,
      "heading_path": [
        "Part 4 Fees",
        "Part 4.6. No fee paid",
        "6.2 Processing the document (other than new trade mark applications)",
        "6.2.1"
      ],
      "heading_source": "emphasis",
      "headings": [
        {
          "level": 3,
          "ref": null,
          "source": "markup"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "ref": "TMM/Part4/6/6/2/1",
          "source": "emphasis"
        }
      ],
      "internal_refs": [],
      "kind": "body",
      "links": [],
      "ordinal": 4,
      "page_ref": "TMM/Part4/6",
      "provisions": [],
      "tables": [],
      "text": "If no fee is paid and there is no authorisation of payment, a Notice of Underpayment (NoU) will be issued."
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "The document and NoU is automatically added to the relevant RIO file."
        }
      ],
      "cases": [],
      "chunk_ref": "TMM/Part4/6/6/2/2",
      "content_hash": "sha256:2528eaadd14e51d6d54297bd5143b6ce592fd345b0c55d5970221d27251ce1ae",
      "fragment": null,
      "heading_path": [
        "Part 4 Fees",
        "Part 4.6. No fee paid",
        "6.2 Processing the document (other than new trade mark applications)",
        "6.2.2"
      ],
      "heading_source": "emphasis",
      "headings": [
        {
          "level": 3,
          "ref": null,
          "source": "markup"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "ref": "TMM/Part4/6/6/2/2",
          "source": "emphasis"
        }
      ],
      "internal_refs": [],
      "kind": "body",
      "links": [],
      "ordinal": 5,
      "page_ref": "TMM/Part4/6",
      "provisions": [],
      "tables": [],
      "text": "The document and NoU is automatically added to the relevant RIO file."
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "The Registrar notifies the person of the non-payment of the fee as soon as possible. If the notification is given verbally it must be confirmed in writing."
        }
      ],
      "cases": [],
      "chunk_ref": "TMM/Part4/6/6/3/1",
      "content_hash": "sha256:b4794fc138510ed2b0bc5f4c5161fe26b9231ac05fbe8907ba79e01baed155b8",
      "fragment": null,
      "heading_path": [
        "Part 4 Fees",
        "Part 4.6. No fee paid",
        "6.3 Notification of non payment",
        "6.3.1"
      ],
      "heading_source": "emphasis",
      "headings": [
        {
          "level": 3,
          "ref": null,
          "source": "markup"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "ref": "TMM/Part4/6/6/3/1",
          "source": "emphasis"
        }
      ],
      "internal_refs": [],
      "kind": "body",
      "links": [],
      "ordinal": 6,
      "page_ref": "TMM/Part4/6",
      "provisions": [],
      "tables": [],
      "text": "The Registrar notifies the person of the non-payment of the fee as soon as possible. If the notification is given verbally it must be confirmed in writing."
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "If the Registrar notifies the person within the 14 days allowed by subsection 223(5) (reg 21.23), the document is taken not to have been filed until the fee is paid."
        }
      ],
      "cases": [],
      "chunk_ref": "TMM/Part4/6/6/3/2",
      "content_hash": "sha256:115d0028d05b8d65ebc2cbf6e97ee03a330135d837e71d55dcfbfb3d9f21bcc1",
      "fragment": null,
      "heading_path": [
        "Part 4 Fees",
        "Part 4.6. No fee paid",
        "6.3 Notification of non payment",
        "6.3.2"
      ],
      "heading_source": "emphasis",
      "headings": [
        {
          "level": 3,
          "ref": null,
          "source": "markup"
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "ref": "TMM/Part4/6/6/3/2",
          "source": "emphasis"
        }
      ],
      "internal_refs": [],
      "kind": "body",
      "links": [],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "page_ref": "TMM/Part4/6",
      "provisions": [
        {
          "certainty": "default",
          "extraction": "regex",
          "id": "TMA1995/s223(5)",
          "mention": "subsection 223(5)"
        },
